  "notes": "Cash-basis county, governmental funds only (no business-type funds). Statement lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p4). Beginning fund balance as originally stated 12,555,668 plus Prior period adjustment (Note 9) 16,955 (Commissary Fund) recorded as an adjustment. The statement 'Taxes' 4,820,828 could not be split fully: the Statement of Activities (p2) prints Property 4,246,686 + Motor Vehicle 509,111 + Lodging tax 65,044 = 4,820,841 (13 more than the fund statement's Taxes; both statements' own totals 9,875,252 tie). Only the lodging tax piece is separated (Visitors Promotion + Visitors Improvement Fund taxes 65,044, equal to the printed Lodging tax); the remainder 4,755,784 stays unlabeled taxes. 'Local' lines are a context label and stay other. Beginning cash not printed (null); ending cash = Cash + Restricted cash on p3 (printed Total Assets), as in later years. Balance sheet from the governmental funds Statement of Assets and Fund Balances (p3), whose totals equal the government-wide Statement of Net Position (p1). Detail: General Fund column from the General Fund budgetary comparison schedule (pp8-9; its actuals tie to the combining General Fund column); the other General Fund sub-funds (Inheritance Tax, Self-Health Insurance, Veterans Aid, Noxious Weed) from the combining statement p5; Road Fund and American Rescue Plan Fund from their budget schedules (pp10-11); nonmajor funds per fund column from the combining statement pp6-7 (Drug Law Enforcement Fund had no activity). Read pages 1-11 of 11"
